flowchart TD
    Input["Untrusted model text"] --> Limit{"Within max_input_chars?"}
    Limit -->|No| Reject["Raise ParseError"]
    Limit -->|Yes| Envelope{"Complete envelope?"}
    Envelope -->|Yes| Payload["Use enveloped payload"]
    Envelope -->|No, optional| Original["Use full input"]
    Envelope -->|No, required| Reject
    Payload --> Candidates["Ordered candidates"]
    Original --> Candidates
    Candidates --> Exact["1. Exact text"]
    Candidates --> Fence["2. Markdown fence body"]
    Candidates --> Surround["3. Object or array substring"]
    Exact --> Validate["JSON decode + schema validation"]
    Fence --> Validate
    Surround --> Validate
    Validate -->|First valid candidate| Result["ParseResult"]
    Validate -->|None valid| RecoveryError["Raise RecoveryError"]
